{"id": 1017698, "slug": "delivery-dash-battle-couriers", "name": "Delivery Dash: Battle Couriers", "name_original": "Delivery Dash: Battle Couriers", "description": "<p>Join the world of Delivery Dash Co., where every package counts and every second matters! Choose your path in this vibrant low-poly city:<br/><br/>Campaign: Follow Alex as they join Delivery Dash Co., guided by Aunt Kate, and take on rival courier companies. Build your reputation, unlock challenges, and grow from rookie to master courier.<br/><br/>Free Play: Grab up to three friends for chaotic split-screen fun! Race through busy streets, dodge traffic, and deliver as many packages as possible before time runs out.<br/><br/>With randomized delivery locations, hazards around every corner, and arcade-style bonuses, every run is a fresh adventure—whether you’re competing against rivals or shaping your own courier story.<br/><br/>Features:<br/><br/>📖 Solo story campaign with characters and rival companies<br/><br/>🎮 2–4 player local split-screen competition<br/><br/>🕹️ Simple, accessible gameplay for all skill levels<br/><br/>📦 Randomized orders and destinations keep each match fresh<br/><br/>🚗 Traffic hazards, bonus modifiers, and power-ups<br/><br/>🏆 Competitive delivery leaderboard at the end of each session in free play mode<br/><br/>Get ready to dash, deliver, and dominate the streets!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2026-01-22", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-05-04T15:56:01", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/92c/92ca821e3567cba60ba30d5df07f4e0b.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3e7/3e781cbc8f745f833943aa74cef17290.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddi